# The C++ twin libraries (verity/ml/definitions/numerics/_jit.py) compile on first use into a per-user cache outside the checkout
# (or $VERITY_NUMERICS_BUILD_DIR).  Until 2026-09-30 they built into cpp/build/, and until 2026-09-23 they were tracked beside
# their .cpp, here in verity_vllm/program/kernels/; these entries keep an older checkout's leftovers out of `git add`.
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/build/
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/*.so
verity_vllm/program/kernels/cpp/*.so.lock
